// EVONUL - solution vectors from an RREF in [I]/[J] with E variable columns.
// D=1 puts the particular solution (from column E+1) first.  Each free column
// then gives one null-space basis vector.  Out: [G]/[H] = E x C, Str5 lists free vars.
// C=0 means the null space is {0} (a single zero column is still built).
// Clobbers: I J K
0→C
For(J,1,E)
If not(ʟMXPR(J)):C+1→C
End
C+D→C
{E,max(1,C)}→dim([G]):{E,max(1,C)}→dim([H])
Fill(0,[G]):Fill(1,[H])
D→K
If D:Then
For(J,1,E)
If ʟMXPR(J):Then
[I](ʟMXPR(J),E+1)→[G](J,1):[J](ʟMXPR(J),E+1)→[H](J,1)
End
End
End
"FREE:"→Str5
For(J,1,E)
If not(ʟMXPR(J)):Then
K+1→K
1→[G](J,K)
Str5+" X"+toString(J)→Str5
For(I,1,E)
If ʟMXPR(I):Then
⁻[I](ʟMXPR(I),J)→[G](I,K):[J](ʟMXPR(I),J)→[H](I,K)
End
End
End
End
If Str5="FREE:":"FREE: NONE"→Str5
